ce is basicaly SE5 with new maps and a new story and a few new and returning weapons. However the formula on SE5 was great, the maps are good, and I belive they added maps with more focus on long range sniping than SE5 and it has pretty much the same ammount of missions as the previous game, meaning I wouldn't classify it as a glorified expansion.\nI recomend it if you finish SE5 wishing for more.\nI do believe however it is easier than the previous game and it was balanced thinking more about playing on authentic, so keep it in mind.", "timestamp_created": 1772138610, "timestamp_updated": 1772138745, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.514128327369689941", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219251456", "author": {"steamid": "76561198174671830", "personaname": "Jarvis", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198174671830/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 3819, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1064, "last_played": 1774019584, "avatar": "839d5f8f631ded9d45efeac44dcf95d8b06af5e0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun but very similar to the last game", "timestamp_created": 1772090136, "timestamp_updated": 1772090136, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}]}